nantCapture` is a core type built in 14 places).\n- Postgres: no origin table and no copy; the design defers it.\n\n## Review\n\nAdversary pass 1 returned NEEDS-CHANGE (an owner without the origin table, the restored queue on\nrefusal, a partial write on a late refusal); all three are fixed and pinned by its tests.\n","status":"active","title":"A tree store copies into SQLite in position order, with every event's origin kept beside it"},"lifecycle_state":"active"},"extra":null,"model_digest":"","owner":"","refs":null,"relations":null,"scope":null,"summary":"","tags":[],"title":"A tree store copies into SQLite in position order, with every event's origin kept beside it","withholds":""},"expected_revision":4,"kind":"execute","operation":"edit","recording":{"actor":"human:timo","causation":"cmd-child-35861265b76d15f309d44e5eab8691e631d8c4487ea3a40348f11ea5b499bc40","correlation":"protocol-artifact-move","record_id":"aep.entity:ent-618aae4276b6ecbd6ebdcd9c9469ec56@3#0~20d8afc59c7b04b2","recorded_at":"2026-09-24T16:15:01Z"},"subject":["story","ent-618aae4276b6ecbd6ebdcd9c9469ec56"]}]